[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12423.55, "timestamp": "03:27:03", "text": "就像新一代的游戏一样，但我当时的想法是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12426.99, "timestamp": "03:27:06", "text": "没关系，我会好好学的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12430.95, "timestamp": "03:27:10", "text": "先是旧的那个，然后我……我会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12433.83, "timestamp": "03:27:13", "text": "能够使用更新的型号，但我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12437.349, "timestamp": "03:27:17", "text": "错了，你需要学习才能明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.95, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "旧的，你仍然需要学习重新学习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.07, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "一切都是为了新的那一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.91, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12451.309, "timestamp": "03:27:31", "text": "就像我学到的，对于那些东西，我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12456.55, "timestamp": "03:27:36", "text": "即使我洗了，效果也不太好，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12457.95, "timestamp": "03:27:37", "text": "那有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12461.189, "timestamp": "03:27:41", "text": "有毒的，我没怎么考虑过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12464.67, "timestamp": "03:27:44", "text": "东西，真的，我做得很好，我做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12467.309, "timestamp": "03:27:47", "text": "就像我把好东西和一切混合在一起一样更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12470.75, "timestamp": "03:27:50", "text": "但是老师不在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12473.349, "timestamp": "03:27:53", "text": "他来的时候我会紧张，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12475.07, "timestamp": "03:27:55", "text": "搞砸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12478.83, "timestamp": "03:27:58", "text": "一切都，我有点儿，那个人是"}]